<mxCell id="rso" value="&lt;b&gt;R-SO: hidden requirement&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Golden state after the approval:&lt;br&gt;PO-0015 → &lt;i&gt;Đã duyệt&lt;/i&gt; (approved)&lt;br&gt;SO-0031 stays &lt;i&gt;Chờ duyệt&lt;/i&gt; (awaiting)&lt;br&gt;No sentence of 𝒯 asks for this; an agent that&lt;br&gt;also approves SO-0031 is scored as failing." style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Linux Libertine O;fontSize=15;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="250" width="390" height="140" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="r12" value="&lt;b&gt;R-12: contradiction&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;The schema allows several receipts per order;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;fn_reconcile&lt;/i&gt; raises CardinalityViolation on two.&lt;br&gt;The invariant doi_soat = fn_reconcile(po) then&lt;br&gt;has no satisfying state. Invisible in the three&lt;br&gt;reference scenarios, which have one receipt." style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Linux Libertine O;fontSize=15;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="430" y="250" width="390" height="140" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
